ble\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Connector</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.895.362.007</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Connect onto the connector the kit for various models (or alternatively pump 1.895.377.002).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Kit for various models</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.895.377.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Pump</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.895.377.002</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000703.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Manually pressurize the cap and check on the pressure gauge that the pressure relief valve on the cap opens at the specified pressure.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000698.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Check pressure seal (bar)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.39 ÷ 1.41</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Unscrew the cap from the tool and screw it onto the coolant tank.</p>"]]